---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: Projects around Agentic AI, RAG systems, recommendations, backend ML, and applied deep learning.
permalink: /projects/
---
<section class="listing" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
  <h1 id="projects-heading">Projects</h1>
  <p class="listing-intro">Selected project notes and build artifacts around retrieval, agents, recommendation systems, backend ML, and applied deep learning.</p>
  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for project in collections.projects %}
      <a class="project-card" href="{{ project.url }}" aria-label="{{ project.data.title }} project">
        <h2>{{ project.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ project.data.description }}</p>
        {% if project.data.tags and project.data.tags.length %}
          <div class="tag-row">
            {% for tag in project.data.tags %}
              <span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
